        "is_free": false,
        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791600/extras/9a4c6b78283593de5418dc7e332f9b61.avif?t=1761245936\" width=1008 height=248 /></span><strong>Simple Rules, Deep Logic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill circular puzzles with the correct numbers using just three simple rules. Rondoku is a calm and minimalist logic game that invites you to slow down, think carefully, and find satisfaction in clever solutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791600/extras/rondoku_steam_gif_diagram.png?t=1761245936\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>70 Hand-Crafted Challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every puzzle in Rondoku is designed by hand. With 70 unique levels, the game offers a thoughtful difficulty curve and a sense of intention in every diagram.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Puzzle Book</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classic puzzle magazines, Rondoku is presented as a book. Flip through its pages freely and enjoy the quiet satisfaction of solving each puzzle, one by one, until the book is complete.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791600/extras/9a4c6b78283593de5418dc7e332f9b61.avif?t=1761245936\" width=1008 height=248 /></span><strong>Simple Rules, Deep Logic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill circular puzzles with the correct numbers using just three simple rules. Rondoku is a calm and minimalist logic game that invites you to slow down, think carefully, and find satisfaction in clever solutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791600/extras/rondoku_steam_gif_diagram.png?t=1761245936\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>70 Hand-Crafted Challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every puzzle in Rondoku is designed by hand. With 70 unique levels, the game offers a thoughtful difficulty curve and a sense of intention in every diagram.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Puzzle Book</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classic puzzle magazines, Rondoku is presented as a book. Flip through its pages freely and enjoy the quiet satisfaction of solving each puzzle, one by one, until the book is complete.</p>",
        "short_description": "Fill elegant diagrams with the correct numbers using three simple rules. Rondoku invites you to think, take your time, and enjoy beautifully hand-crafted challenges.",
